      "description": "Manufacturing Extension Steep-and-Shallow finishing — combines parallel 3D for shallow regions and constant-Z for steep regions in a single operation. Removes the manual setup of two ops + transitions. Detection threshold defines steep vs shallow boundary. Standard for mould-cavity and aerospace finishing where surface direction varies.",
